  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<div><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>FQI values for forests.<br /></span></div><div><span style='color:rgb(50, 49, 48); font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe WP&quot;, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px;'>Forest vegetation data were collected annually at Long-term Monitoring Program plots using fixed plots. Floristic Quality Index values were calculated for each plot in each year. The % exotic represents the percentage of exotics species occurring in the plot out of the total number of species (both native and exotic). If a site contained more than one survey station an average was taken. Averages were calculated for each 5 year period and compared.</span><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><br /></span></div><div><span style='color:rgb(50, 49, 48); font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe WP&quot;, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px;'>Data is for period ending: </span><font color='#323130' face='Segoe UI, Segoe WP, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif'><span style='font-size:14px;'>12/31/2019</span></font></div><div><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><br /></span></div><div><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>View the </span><a href='https://storymaps.arcgis.com/stories/72fec6db9b894e8d8a50eb97c320f666' rel='nofollow ugc' style='color:rgb(0, 121, 193); text-decoration-line:none; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;' target='_blank'>Natural Heritage System Reporting Key</a><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'> for detailed information about target setting and evaluation of current conditions and trends, including data collection and analysis methodologies.</span></div>"
